    ('<li><span class="os-win">About 19 MB in memory</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>About 13 MB in memory</span></li>',
     '<li><span class="os-win">メモリ約 19 MB</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>メモリ約 13 MB</span></li>'),
    ('<a class="cue" href="#gestures"><span class="cue-ico"><svg width="22" height="34" viewBox="0 0 22 34" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="20" height="32" rx="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M11 1v12M1 13h20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path class="rb" d="M11.8 1.8h0a8.6 8.6 0 0 1 8.4 8.4V12.2H11.8Z"/></svg><svg class="cue-trail" width="14" height="40" viewBox="0 0 14 40" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M7 2V36M2 31l5 5 5-5"/></svg></span><span class="os-win">Scroll, or hold right-click and draw down</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Scroll to explore</span></a>',
     '<a class="cue" href="#gestures"><span class="cue-ico"><svg width="22" height="34" viewBox="0 0 22 34" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="20" height="32" rx="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M11 1v12M1 13h20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path class="rb" d="M11.8 1.8h0a8.6 8.6 0 0 1 8.4 8.4V12.2H11.8Z"/></svg><svg class="cue-trail" width="14" height="40" viewBox="0 0 14 40" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M7 2V36M2 31l5 5 5-5"/></svg></span><span class="os-win">スクロール、または右ボタンを押したまま下へ描く</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>スクロールして詳しく見る</span></a>'),
    ('<li data-p="50,0,0,0" data-act="back"><span class="glyph"></span><span class="nm">Back<small><span class="os-win">In browsers and File Explorer</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>In browsers and Finder</span></small></span><span class="ar">←</span></li>',
     '<li data-p="50,0,0,0" data-act="back"><span class="glyph"></span><span class="nm">戻る<small><span class="os-win">ブラウザとエクスプローラーで</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>ブラウザーや Finder で使えます</span></small></span><span class="ar">←</span></li>'),
    ('<p class="note">While you draw, the gesture name appears near the bottom of the screen; anything it doesn\'t recognize does nothing. The same gesture can do different things in different apps.</p>',
     '<p class="note">描いている間は画面下部にジェスチャー名が表示され、認識できなければ何もしません。同じジェスチャーでも、アプリごとに違う操作を割り当てられます。</p>'),
    ('<li><button type="button" data-edge="12"><span class="where">Bottom left</span><span class="what"><span class="os-win">Start menu</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Spotlight</span></span></button></li>',
     '<li><button type="button" data-edge="12"><span class="where">左下</span><span class="what"><span class="os-win">スタートメニュー</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Spotlight</span></span></button></li>'),
    ('<li><button type="button" data-edge="9"><span class="where">Top left</span><span class="what"><span class="os-win">Switch to the previous app</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mission Control</span></span></button></li>',
     '<li><button type="button" data-edge="9"><span class="where">左上</span><span class="what"><span class="os-win">前のアプリへ切替</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mission Control</span></span></button></li>'),
    ('<li><button type="button" data-edge="1" data-with="wheel"><span class="where">Top edge</span><span class="what">Scroll for volume<small class="os-win">Middle-click mutes, right-click plays / pauses</small></span></button></li>',
     '<li><button type="button" data-edge="1" data-with="wheel"><span class="where">上端</span><span class="what">ホイールで音量<small class="os-win">中クリックでミュート、右クリックで再生 / 一時停止</small></span></button></li>'),
    ('<div><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="12" rx="2.5"/><path d="M6.5 10h.01M10 10h.01M13.5 10h.01M17 10h.01M7.5 14h9"/></svg></span><dt>Send keys</dt><dd>Any shortcut or sequence of keys, such as <code class="os-win">Ctrl+Shift+T</code><code class="os-mac" hidden>⌘⇧T</code>.</dd></div>',
     '<div><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="12" rx="2.5"/><path d="M6.5 10h.01M10 10h.01M13.5 10h.01M17 10h.01M7.5 14h9"/></svg></span><dt>キーを送る</dt><dd><code class="os-win">Ctrl+Shift+T</code><code class="os-mac" hidden>⌘⇧T</code> など、任意のショートカットやキー列。</dd></div>'),
    ('<div><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 19 19 5M9 5h10v10"/></svg></span><dt>Open an app</dt><dd>Start an app or open a file, with optional arguments.</dd></div>',
     '<div><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 19 19 5M9 5h10v10"/></svg></span><dt>アプリを開く</dt><dd>アプリやファイルを開けます。必要に応じて起動引数も指定できます。</dd></div>'),
    ('<div><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 8 4 4-4 4M12 17h7"/></svg></span><dt>Run a command</dt><dd>Run a command, with variables when needed.</dd></div>',
     '<div><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 8 4 4-4 4M12 17h7"/></svg></span><dt>コマンド実行</dt><dd>コマンドを実行します。必要に応じて変数も使えます。</dd></div>'),
    ('<p><span class="os-win">Remote desktop, 3D and design apps use right- and middle-drag for themselves. On first run, Mousetroke finds the ones you have installed; tick them to turn gestures off inside them.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>On Mac, gestures are off by default in remote desktop, virtual machine and 3D apps, including Windows App, Screen Sharing, Parallels Desktop and Blender. Change these rules in settings.</span></p>',
     '<p><span class="os-win">リモートデスクトップや 3D・デザイン系アプリは、右・中ボタンのドラッグを自分で使います。初回起動時にインストール済みのものを検出するので、チェックすればその中ではジェスチャがオフになります。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac では、Windows App、画面共有、Parallels Desktop、Blender などのリモートデスクトップ・仮想マシン・3D アプリで、初期設定からジェスチャーを無効にしています。設定で変更できます。</span></p>'),
    ('<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#2b6cb0">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">Remote Desktop Connection</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Windows App</span></b><small><span class="os-win">mstsc.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.microsoft.rdc.macos</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in Remote Desktop Connection"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in Windows App"></span></div>',
     '<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#2b6cb0">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">リモートデスクトップ接続</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Windows App</span></b><small><span class="os-win">mstsc.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.microsoft.rdc.macos</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="リモートデスクトップ接続 でジェスチャーを使う"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Windows App でジェスチャーを使う"></span></div>'),
    ('<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#d42c2c">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">AnyDesk</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Screen Sharing</span></b><small><span class="os-win">AnyDesk.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.apple.ScreenSharing</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in AnyDesk"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in Screen Sharing"></span></div>',
     '<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#d42c2c">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">AnyDesk</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Screen Sharing</span></b><small><span class="os-win">AnyDesk.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.apple.ScreenSharing</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="AnyDesk でジェスチャーを使う"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Screen Sharing でジェスチャーを使う"></span></div>'),
    ('<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#e87d0d">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">Blender</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Blender</span></b><small><span class="os-win">blender.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>org.blenderfoundation.blender</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in Blender"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in Blender"></span></div>',
     '<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#e87d0d">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">Blender</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Blender</span></b><small><span class="os-win">blender.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>org.blenderfoundation.blender</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Blender でジェスチャーを使う"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Blender でジェスチャーを使う"></span></div>'),
    ('<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#c62828">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">AutoCAD</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Parallels Desktop</span></b><small><span class="os-win">acad.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.parallels.desktop.console</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in AutoCAD"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Use gestures in Parallels Desktop"></span></div>',
     '<div class="row off"><span class="ai" style="background:#c62828">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">AutoCAD</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Parallels Desktop</span></b><small><span class="os-win">acad.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.parallels.desktop.console</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ無効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="AutoCAD でジェスチャーを使う"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" aria-label="Parallels Desktop でジェスチャーを使う"></span></div>'),
    ('<div class="row"><span class="ai" style="background:#0098d9">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">Google Chrome</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Google Chrome</span></b><small><span class="os-win">chrome.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.google.Chrome</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ有効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Use gestures in Google Chrome"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Use gestures in Google Chrome"></span></div>',
     '<div class="row"><span class="ai" style="background:#0098d9">•</span><span class="an"><b><span class="os-win">Google Chrome</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Google Chrome</span></b><small><span class="os-win">chrome.exe</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>com.google.Chrome</span></small></span><span class="state" data-on="ジェスチャ有効" data-off="ジェスチャ無効">ジェスチャ有効</span><span class="os-win"><input class="sw" type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Google Chrome でジェスチャーを使う"></span><span class="os-mac" hidden><input class="sw" type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Google Chrome でジェスチャーを使う"></span></div>'),
    ('<li><b>Pause any time</b><span class="os-win">Press <kbd>Win</kbd> + <kbd>Esc</kbd> to pause or resume; the tray icon turns gray.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Press <kbd>⌃</kbd> + <kbd>⌥</kbd> + <kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>P</kbd> to pause or resume. You can change the shortcut in settings or pause from the menu-bar menu.</span></li>',
     '<li><b>いつでも一時停止</b><span class="os-win"><kbd>Win</kbd> + <kbd>Esc</kbd> で停止 / 再開。トレイアイコンが灰色になります。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden><kbd>⌃</kbd> + <kbd>⌥</kbd> + <kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>P</kbd> で一時停止・再開できます。ショートカットは設定で変更でき、メニューバーのメニューからも一時停止できます。</span></li>'),
    ('<li><b>Adding an app is quick</b><span class="os-win">Drag its exe or shortcut into the settings window, or click “Pick a window” and click that app\'s window.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Choose an .app in settings, or click “Pick a window” and click that app\'s window.</span></li>',
     '<li><b>アプリの追加は簡単</b><span class="os-win">exe やショートカットを設定ウィンドウにドロップ、または「ウィンドウを指定」してその窓をクリック。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>設定で .app を選ぶか、「ウィンドウを選択」を押して対象アプリのウィンドウをクリックします。</span></li>'),
    ('<p><span class="os-win">The gesture engine is written in Rust and talks to Windows directly, with no browser engine and no runtime. The settings window is a separate process that opens only when you need it.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>The native gesture engine is written in Rust. On Mac it uses AppKit and CGEventTap; settings use the system WebKit, with no WebView2 needed.</span></p>',
     '<p><span class="os-win">ジェスチャエンジンは Rust で書かれ、Windows と直接やり取りします。ブラウザエンジンもランタイムも不要。設定画面は必要なときだけ開く別プロセスです。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>ネイティブのジェスチャーエンジンは Rust 製です。Mac では AppKit と CGEventTap を直接使用し、設定画面にはシステムの WebKit を使います。WebView2 は不要です。</span></p>'),
    ('<div><dt>Resident memory</dt><dd><span class="os-win">19</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>13</span><small>MB</small></dd><p><span class="os-win">Measured working set, about 10 MB private; no CPU when idle.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>About 13 MB physical footprint in Activity Monitor; no CPU when idle.</span></p></div>',
     '<div><dt>常駐メモリ</dt><dd><span class="os-win">19</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>13</span><small>MB</small></dd><p><span class="os-win">実測ワーキングセット。プライベート約 10 MB、アイドル時の CPU はゼロ。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>アクティビティモニタでの物理メモリ使用量は約 13 MB。待機中は CPU を使いません。</span></p></div>'),
    ('<div><dt>Download</dt><dd><span class="os-win">13.1<small>MB</small></span><span class="os-mac" hidden>8.1<small>MB</small></span></dd><p><span class="os-win">One exe that runs from anywhere. Nothing goes in the registry unless you turn on start with Windows.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Drag Mousetroke from the DMG into Applications. Manage launch at login in System Settings.</span></p></div>',
     '<div><dt>ダウンロード</dt><dd><span class="os-win">13.1<small>MB</small></span><span class="os-mac" hidden>8.1<small>MB</small></span></dd><p><span class="os-win">どこからでも動く単一 exe。Windows 起動時の実行を有効にしない限り、レジストリには何も書きません。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>DMG 内の Mousetroke を「アプリケーション」にドラッグします。ログイン時の起動はシステム設定のログイン項目で管理します。</span></p></div>'),
    ('<p class="pt">Open settings, pause or quit from the menu-bar menu. Manage launch at login in System Settings.</p></div>',
     '<p class="pt">設定・一時停止・終了はメニューバーのメニューから。ログイン時の起動はシステム設定のログイン項目で管理します。</p></div>'),
    ('<details open><summary>Does the right-click menu still work with Mousetroke?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. A right-click without dragging is passed back to the system unchanged, so the context menu opens as usual. Holding still past the drag timeout (0.5 seconds by default, adjustable) also becomes a normal right-drag.</p></div></details>',
     '<details open><summary>右クリックのメニューは今までどおり使えますか？</summary><div class="ans"><p>使えます。ドラッグせずに右クリックすると、そのクリックがそのままシステムに渡り、通常どおりメニューが開きます。設定した待機時間（初期値 0.5 秒、変更可能）を超えて動かさずに押し続けると、通常の右ドラッグになります。</p></div></details>'),
    ('<details><summary>Will it misfire in games or remote desktop?</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: Fullscreen games, video and presentations pause gestures automatically. Programs that need right- or middle-drag themselves, such as Remote Desktop, AnyDesk, Blender or AutoCAD, can be excluded in one click on first run. Win+Esc pauses at any time.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: Gestures pause automatically for fullscreen games, video and presentations. Remote desktop, virtual machine and 3D apps can be excluded in settings. The default pause shortcut is ⌃⌥⌘P; you can change it.</span></p></div></details>',
     '<details><summary>ゲームやリモートデスクトップで誤発動しませんか？</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: 全画面のゲーム・動画・プレゼンではジェスチャが自動で一時停止します。リモートデスクトップ、AnyDesk、Blender、AutoCAD など右・中ドラッグを自分で使うプログラムは、初回起動にワンクリックで除外できます。Win+Esc でいつでも停止できます。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: 全画面のゲーム・動画・プレゼン中は自動で一時停止します。リモートデスクトップ・仮想マシン・3D アプリは設定で除外できます。一時停止の初期ショートカットは ⌃⌥⌘P で、変更も可能です。</span></p></div></details>'),
    ('<details><summary>Which operating systems are supported?</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: Windows 10 1809 or later and Windows 11, 64-bit. The gesture engine has no runtime dependencies; the settings window uses Microsoft Edge WebView2, which ships with Windows 11 and comes with Edge on most Windows 10 PCs.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: macOS 11 or later, on Apple silicon and Intel. The native engine uses AppKit and CGEventTap; settings use the system WebKit. Grant Accessibility on first open. Enable Input Monitoring only if setup asks for it on an older macOS version.</span></p></div></details>',
     '<details><summary>対応する OS は？</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: Windows 10 1809 以降と Windows 11 の 64 ビットです。ジェスチャエンジンにランタイム依存はありません。設定画面は Microsoft Edge WebView2 を使います（Windows 11 に標準搭載、ほとんどの Windows 10 には Edge と共にあります）。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: macOS 11 以降の Apple silicon・Intel Mac に対応します。ネイティブエンジンは AppKit と CGEventTap、設定画面はシステムの WebKit を使用します。初回起動時にアクセシビリティを許可してください。古い macOS でガイドに求められた場合のみ、入力監視も有効にしてください。</span></p></div></details>'),
    ('<details><summary>How much memory and CPU does it use?</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: The resident gesture engine uses about 19 MB working set (about 10 MB private) and no CPU when idle. The settings window is a separate process that only runs while it is open.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: The resident gesture engine uses about 13 MB physical footprint in Activity Monitor and no CPU when idle. Open settings from the menu-bar menu.</span></p></div></details>',
     '<details><summary>メモリと CPU の使用量は？</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: 常駐エンジンはワーキングセット約 19 MB（プライベート約 10 MB）、アイドル時の CPU はゼロです。設定画面は開いている間だけ動く別プロセスです。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: 常駐エンジンの物理メモリ使用量はアクティビティモニタで約 13 MB。待機中は CPU を使いません。設定はメニューバーのメニューから開けます。</span></p></div></details>'),
    ('<details><summary>Where are the settings stored, and how do I back them up?</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: In <code>%APPDATA%\\mousetroke\\config.json</code>. Settings has import and export. Saved changes take effect within about a second, without a restart.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: Settings are in <code>~/Library/Application Support/mousetroke/config.json</code>; logs are in <code>~/Library/Logs/mousetroke/</code>. Use import and export in settings to back up your configuration.</span></p></div></details>',
     '<details><summary>設定はどこに保存されますか？バックアップは？</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: <code>%APPDATA%\\mousetroke\\config.json</code> です。設定画面にインポート・エクスポートがあります。保存した変更は再起動なしに約 1 秒で反映されます。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: 設定は <code>~/Library/Application Support/mousetroke/config.json</code>、ログは <code>~/Library/Logs/mousetroke/</code> に保存されます。設定画面のインポート・エクスポートでバックアップできます。</span></p></div></details>'),
    ('<details><summary>How do I uninstall it?</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: Turn off start with Windows in preferences, choose Quit from the tray icon menu, then delete mousetroke.exe and the <code>%APPDATA%\\mousetroke</code> folder. Nothing else is left behind.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: Quit from the menu bar, delete Mousetroke.app, ~/Library/Application Support/mousetroke and ~/Library/Logs/mousetroke, and remove the Mousetroke login item in System Settings.</span></p></div></details>',
     '<details><summary>アンインストールの方法は？</summary><div class="ans"><p><span class="os-win">Windows: 設定で Windows 起動時の実行をオフにし、トレイアイコンのメニューから終了を選び、mousetroke.exe と <code>%APPDATA%\\mousetroke</code> フォルダーを削除するだけです。他には何も残りません。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Mac: メニューバーから終了し、Mousetroke.app、~/Library/Application Support/mousetroke、~/Library/Logs/mousetroke を削除して、システム設定で Mousetroke のログイン項目を取り除きます。</span></p></div></details>'),
    ('<h2 id="h-get">Download Mousetroke</h2>',
     '<h2 id="h-get">Mousetroke をダウンロード</h2>'),
    ('<p><span class="os-win">No installer. An icon appears in the notification area: left-click it for settings, right-click to pause or quit. A four-step guide walks you through the first run.</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>Open settings, pause or quit from the menu-bar menu. Manage launch at login in System Settings.</span></p>',
     '<p><span class="os-win">インストーラー不要。通知領域にアイコンが現れます：左クリックで設定、右クリックで一時停止や終了。初回は 4 ステップのガイドが付いてきます。</span><span class="os-mac" hidden>設定・一時停止・終了はメニューバーのメニューから。ログイン時の起動はシステム設定のログイン項目で管理します。</span></p>'),
